# Misc
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
temp/

# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   aspire-output/docker-compose.yaml   — the committed deployment artifact
#   samples/                            — sample brief and art references
#   devpost/*.md, devpost/*.html        — the planning record
